## 10. Complete Request Flow (example: purchasing and taking a course)

```
1. Flutter → POST /purchase/:courseId/initiate (with Bearer token)
2. Express → requireAuth verifies token via Supabase → gets userId
3. Express → Paystack API → returns checkout URL
4. Flutter opens checkout URL in webview → student pays
5. Paystack → POST /webhooks/paystack (server-to-server, signed)
6. Express verifies signature → creates/extends Subscription in Postgres
7. Flutter polls GET /courses/:courseId → sees access: "ACTIVE"
8. Flutter → POST /courses/:courseId/attempts → Express snapshots questions, creates Attempt
9. Flutter autosaves answers via PATCH .../answers/:questionId as the student progresses
10. Flutter → POST /attempts/:attemptId/submit → Express grades server-side, returns score
11. Flutter → GET /results/:attemptId and /attempts/:attemptId/review
```

