## 14. Common Errors You'll Likely Hit

| Symptom | Likely cause |
|---|---|
| Prisma "too many connections" | Using the direct DB URL instead of the pooler URL for `DATABASE_URL` |
| `requireAuth` always returns 401 | Client not sending `Authorization: Bearer <token>`, or sending the refresh token instead of the access token |
| Paystack webhook signature never matches | Body already parsed as JSON before signature check — must use `express.raw()` on that route |
| Duplicate scores on double-submit | Idempotency key not being generated/sent by the client, or not enforced as `@unique` in Prisma |
| RLS blocks your own Express queries | You're using the `anon`/publishable key instead of `service_role` in your backend Supabase client |
| Attempt review shows different questions than what was answered | Querying live `Question` table for review instead of the frozen `questionSnapshot` |